  "description": "In the complex world of gears and gadgets you can still find simplicity. Shoreliner sports a high-quality Shimano Nexus 3 speed hub with a twist shifter to match, decision making doesn't get much easier than low, medium, and high when you are negotiating rolling terrain. Add in Del Sol's 6000 series aluminum SuperCruise frame with a Step-Thru option, an oversized Del Sol springer saddle, swept back bars and grips, and coordinated full fenders and chainguard and you are ready to roll in the ultimate combination of comfort and style.\nLightweight alloy SuperCruise frame featuring longer, more laid-back geometry for the perfect cruise\nShimano Nexus 3-speed coaster brake rear hub and Revo twist shifter\n3-piece alloy crankset\nCustom Del Sol Cruiser bars for the most comfortable hand position\nNew Del Sol elastomer-sprung cruiser saddle\nFull matching fenders keep the sand off your suit\nLightweight & rust-free alloy rims\nSmooth-riding 26\" x 2.125\" cruiser tires",
